  "description": "The package contains a set of predefined custom items for WinForms Dashboards. The Custom Dashboard Items feature allows you to embed any WinForms control into the DevExpress Dashboard. Created custom items have the same functionality as built-in dashboard items.\nSee: https://docs.devexpress.com/Dashboard/403031/winforms-dashboard/winforms-designer/create-a-custom-item\n\nRefer to the following link for more information on how to integrate custom items into your project: https://github.com/DevExpress-Examples/winforms-dashboard-custom-items-extension#integrate-a-custom-item-to-your-project",
